# 14. Developer Rule of Thumb

```text
Need ordered, changeable data?
→ List

Need ordered, fixed data?
→ Tuple

Need unique values?
→ Set

Need fast/simple membership checking?
→ Set

Need common/different/group comparison?
→ Set operations
```

Don't treat these as absolute rules. The correct data structure ultimately depends on the problem and the operations your program needs.

